          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For a small, regularly mowed lawn, a compact battery mower like the Greenworks 40V 16-inch is the easiest to own. If your yard slopes or the grass grows thick, step up to the EGO LM2135SP. Corded mowers like the Sun Joe and Black+Decker are the cheapest option near an outlet, a reel mower suits frequent mowers with smooth lawns, and a robot is the answer if you want to stop mowing altogether.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
